        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Shot look match across a sequence\n\n1. Read (top): the edited sequence or generated shots. Read (bottom): the hero/reference frame.\n2. Scene Cut Detect finds the cuts; its score plot shows in the small viewer.\n3. Scene Cut Split takes one shot by shot_index: step it 0, 1, 2... and queue once per shot.\n4. Grade Match matches that shot to the reference; CDL adds a shared trim.\n5. QC checks clipping and banding; Write saves each shot as an EXR sequence. Put the shot number in filename so shots don't overwrite each other.\nViewer: matched shot vs the original."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Shot look match across a sequence\n\n1. Read (top): the edited sequence or generated shots. Read (bottom): the hero/reference frame.\n2. Scene Cut Detect finds the cuts; its score plot shows in the small viewer.\n3. Scene Cut Split takes one shot by shot_index: step it 0, 1, 2... and queue once per shot.\n4. Grade Match matches that shot to the reference; CDL adds a shared trim.\n5. QC checks clipping and banding; Write saves each shot as an EXR sequence. Put the shot number in filename so shots don't overwrite each other.\nViewer: matched shot vs the original."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
